  "title": "Katekyou Hitman Reborn!",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 80975 and TMDB show 45857. AniDB episode 34-65 (\"ヴァリアー来る!\" (Varia Comes!) to \"決着!\" (Showdown!)) are TVDB S2E1 \"The Varia Arrive\" to TVDB S2E32 \"Conclusion!\" and TMDB S2E34 \"ヴァリアー来る！\" (The Varia Arrive) to TMDB S2E65 \"決着！\" (Conclusion!); AniDB episode 66-73 (\"ふるえてゴースト\" (Shivering Ghost) to \"母さん感謝の日\" (Mother Appreciation Day)) are TVDB S3E1 \"Shivering Ghost\" to TVDB S3E8 \"Mother's Day\" and TMDB S3E66 \"ふるえてゴースト\" (Shivering Ghost) to TMDB S3E73 \"母さん感謝の日\" (Mother's Day Vongola-style); AniDB episode 74-101 (\"十年後の世界\" (The World Ten Years Later) to \"夜襲\" (Night Raid)) are TVDB S4E1 \"The World Ten Years Later\" to TVDB S4E28 \"Night Attack\" and TMDB S4E74 \"１０年後の世界\" (The World Ten Years Later) to TMDB S4E101 \"夜襲\" (Night Attack); AniDB episode 102-140 (\"作戦開始\" (Operation Start) to \"もう一つの大空\" (Another Sky)) are TVDB S5E1 \"Mission Start\" to TVDB S5E39 \"Another Sky\" and TMDB S4E102 \"作戦開始\" (Mission Start) to TMDB S4E140 \"もう一つの大空\" (Another Sky); AniDB episode 141 \"再会\" (Reunion) is TVDB S6E1 \"Reunion\" and TMDB S4E141 \"再会\" (Reunion); AniDB episode 142-153 (\"最強の7人\" (The Strongest Seven) to \"最後の印\" (The Last Mark)) are TVDB S6E2 \"The Strongest Seven\" to TVDB S6E13 \"The Final Seal\" and TMDB S5E142 \"最強の７人\" (The Strongest Seven) to TMDB S5E153 \"最後の印\" (The Final Seal); AniDB episode 154 \"次なる戦いへ\" (To the Next Battle) is TVDB S7E1 \"To the Next Battle\" and TMDB S5E154 \"次なる戦いへ\" (To the Next Battle); AniDB episode 155-177 (\"真(リアル)6弔花\" (The Real Six Funeral Wreaths) to \"戦いの後\" (After the Battle)) are TVDB S7E2 \"The Real Six Funeral Wreaths\" to TVDB S7E24 \"After the Battle\" and TMDB S6E155 \"真６弔花\" (The Real Six Funeral Wreaths) to TMDB S6E177 \"戦いの後\" (After the Battle); AniDB episode 178-189 (\"I世(プリーモ)ファミリー来る!\" (The Primo Family Arrives!) to \"ファミリーの覚悟\" (The Family`s Resolve)) are TVDB S8E1 \"The Primo Family Arrives!\" to TVDB S8E12 \"The Family's Resolve\" and TMDB S7E178 \"Ⅰ世ファミリー来る！\" (The Primo Family Arrives) to TMDB S7E189 \"ファミリーの覚悟\" (The Family's Resolve); AniDB episode 190-203 (\"真6弔花(リアルろくちょうか)襲来\" (The Real Six Funeral Wreaths Attack!) to \"新しい未来へ\" (To a New Future)) are TVDB S9E1 \"The Real Six Funeral Wreaths Attack!\" to TVDB S9E14 \"To a New Future\" and TMDB S8E190 \"真６弔花襲来\" (The Real Six Funeral Wreaths Attack!) to TMDB S8E203 \"新しい未来へ\" (To a New Future); AniDB S2 \"『家庭教師ヒットマンREBORN!』×『エルドライブ【ēlDLIVE】』SPコラボミニアニメ[24H]\" (Katekyo Hitman Reborn! x elDLIVE Special Collaboration) is TMDB S0E5 \"Katekyo Hitman Reborn! x elDLIVE Special Collaboration\" and has no TVDB episode (TVDB has no S0E2); AniDB S3-S5 (\"ミスターリボックのちゃおちゃおインタビュー vol.1\" (Mr. Rebokku`s Ciao Ciao Interview with Tsuna, Gokudera and Xanxus) to \"ミスターリボックのちゃおちゃおインタビュー vol.3\" (Mr. Rebokku`s Final Ciao Ciao Interview with Yamamoto, Squalo, Byakuran and Mukuro)) are TMDB S0E2 \"Mr. Rebokku no Ciao Ciao 1\" to TMDB S0E4 \"Mr. Rebokku no Ciao Ciao 3\" and have no TVDB episode (TVDB has none of them).",
